| Number-tile history kept in the folder (`.agents/dashboard/history/<id>.jsonl`); the Dashboard says its tiles and trends are folder files | #127 | **has** | The window, the Remote and the page end the Dashboard with *Tiles and their trends are files in .agents/dashboard/ in this folder, which you may commit.* A number tile's detail adds a **History** row naming its file, on the window and the page (the Remote has no detail). The trend itself comes from the host as before, so nothing else on the page changed. |
